ELF, dynamic adapter/RocksDB linkage, and v1-only verification references.
The supplied adapter directory contains `adapter.h` and `librosetta.so`; no
instrumented native library was supplied. Valgrind was not available. Native
ASan, whole-service race detection, and power-loss behavior are not claimed.

