FSEvents diagnostics before successfully forwarding requests. These did not
prevent broker builds/tests; their exact overhead is unknown. API token usage
and monetary cost are not exposed by the tools and are recorded as unknown.
No controlled performance trials were run. No failed measurement was discarded
or replaced as though it had succeeded.

